<title>RUSSIA: Details of Russian company tax arrears (May 1).</title>
<headline>Details of Russian company tax arrears (May 1).</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of Russian companies with major tax arrears as of May 1, 1997, according to the State Tax Service.</p>
<p>The amount owed by the listed companies totalled 32.7 trillion roubles ($5.7 billion), up from 31.2 trillion roubles ($5.4 billion) on April 1.</p>
<p>Companies marked (*) were not listed by the Tax Service as having major tax arrears as of April 1.</p>
